.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
implements the GTK2 specific part of the context-menus. 


.SH "Function Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "static void menu_add (GtkWidget * menu, menu_action * m, action_context * ac)\fC [static]\fP"
.PP
add action to context-menu. 
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fImenu\fP the GTK menu 
.br
\fIm\fP the menu-action 
.br
\fIac\fP the action-context
.RE
.PP

.SS "static void menu_count_items (GtkWidget * widget, gpointer data)\fC [static]\fP"
.PP
count items in context-menu. 
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fIwidget\fP an item in the menu (ignored) 
.br
\fIdata\fP a pointer to the counter-variable
.RE
.PP

.SS "static int menu_create (action_context * ac, GtkWidget * menu)\fC [static]\fP"
.PP
create and display context-menu (according to item this menu is for). 
.PP
\fBReturns:\fP
.RS 4
<0 (error-code) or >=0 (# of items in menu; 0==none, meaning that no menu is shown) 
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fIac\fP the action-context 
.br
\fImenu\fP menu-object (may hand-in previously made menu with extra items; created inside if NULL)
.RE
.PP

.SS "static void menu_done (GtkMenuShell * menushell, gpointer data)\fC [static]\fP"
.PP
closing menu. 
.PP
release all admin data.
.SS "int menu_path (\fBnoir_sess\fP * ns, int button, long when)"
.PP
show menu containing all paths leading up to cwd. 
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fIns\fP - session 
.br
\fIbutton\fP - what mouse-button caused the menu to open? 
.br
\fIwhen\fP - when did the click occur?
.RE
.PP

.SS "int menu_root_context (\fBnoir_sess\fP * ns, const char * cwd, int mb)"
.PP
create and show 'root-menu'. 
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fIns\fP session 
.br
\fIcwd\fP current work-dir (may differ from session's if view can show more than one directory at a time) 
.br
\fImb\fP the mouse-button that was pressed to open the menu
.RE
.PP

.SS "int menu_run (action_context * ac, void * menu)"
.PP
handle a menu. 
.PP
(called from \fBmenu_file_context()\fP for context-menus and from root_menu() for 'root'-menus.) 
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fIac\fP the action-context 
.br
\fImenu\fP a pre-made GTK-menu to append entries to, or NULL to create a new menu
.RE
.PP

.SS "static GtkWidget* menu_selection_add (action_context * ac, GtkWidget * menu, char * title, gpointer data)\fC [static]\fP"
.PP
add action 'title' to context-menu 'menu' for current selection. 
.PP
called from \fBmenu_selection_create()\fP. 
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fIac\fP the action-context 
.br
\fImenu\fP the GTK menu to add to 
.br
\fItitle\fP the title for the menu entry 
.br
\fIdata\fP the data to set on the entry (an action (menu_action *), or NULL)
.RE
.PP

