.br
\fIdata\fP - the action-context
.RE
.PP

.SS "static gint menu_selection_apply_one (const char * file, GtkWidget * item, menu_action * menu, action_context * ac)\fC [inline, static]\fP"
.PP
apply action from context-menu to a single file. 
.PP
