\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fIac\fP the action-context
.RE
.PP

.SS "static GtkWidget* menu_selection_insensitive (GtkWidget * item)\fC [static]\fP"
.PP
set menu item insensitve (disabled) 
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fIitem\fP the GTK menu-item to disable
.RE
.PP

.SS "static gint menu_single_apply (GtkWidget * item, gpointer data)\fC [static]\fP"
.PP
wrapper for menu_selection_apply_one so it can be called by GTK. 
.PP
this is called when a menu-entry pertaining to a single file (rather than a selection of files) is activated; see menu_add. in this case, NULL will be passed to menu_selected_do in lieu of an action_context. 
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fIitem\fP the menu-item that was selected. its 'data' property will contain the anchor of the file's meta-data. 
.br
\fIdata\fP the menu-action.
.RE
.PP

